{
  "id": "22q11-2-deletion-syndrome",
  "term": "22q11.2 deletion syndrome",
  "definition": "22q11.2 deletion syndrome is a neurogenetic disorder linked to a markedly increased risk of schizophrenia and other psychosis-related symptoms. In psychology and psychiatry, it is often studied as a condition that can help identify cognitive, clinical, and brain-based markers of psychosis risk.",
